{"product_id":"flex-smart-watch","title":"Flex Smartwatch","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"328\" data-end=\"644\"\u003eMeet the \u003cstrong data-start=\"337\" data-end=\"356\"\u003eFlex Smartwatch\u003c\/strong\u003e, a powerful everyday companion designed to keep up with your dynamic lifestyle. Built for comfort, connectivity, and performance, the Flex Smartwatch combines a modern full-color touch display with smart calling, health tracking, and fitness features that support you throughout the day.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"646\" data-end=\"941\"\u003eWith Bluetooth calling, real-time smart notifications, and an intuitive interface, Flex lets you stay connected without reaching for your phone. Its advanced health suite tracks your heart rate, sleep patterns, and daily activity, while multiple workout modes help you stay active and motivated.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"943\" data-end=\"1180\"\u003eFeaturing customizable watch faces, a comfortable interchangeable strap, and reliable multi-day battery life, the Flex Smartwatch adapts effortlessly to work, workouts, and weekends—making it the perfect blend of style and functionality.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Red Gold","offer_id":47461985517846,"sku":"19620","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black","offer_id":47464161444118,"sku":"19617","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black Gold","offer_id":47461985419542,"sku":"19622","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Green Gold","offer_id":47461985485078,"sku":"19619","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Blue","offer_id":47461985452310,"sku":"19618","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/r3.webp?v=1737960947","url":"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/products\/flex-smart-watch","provider":"ZeroLifestyle.co","version